LEADING ZEROS
Region { start: Position { line: 1, column: 9 }, end: Position { line: 1, column: 9 } }

I do not accept numbers with leading zeros:

Just delete the leading zeros and it should work! Some languages use a leading
zero to specify octal numbers. Nash avoids this ambiguity.
